<li><strong>Report an Issue</strong> (Help menu): send a bug report or feature request from inside the app. It becomes a GitHub issue; you see exactly which diagnostics are attached before sending (app and macOS version, Mac model, helper status — never process names, paths or personal data).</li>
<li>If sending fails, the report opens pre-filled on GitHub in your browser instead.</li>
</ul>
